# Cursor & Codex Rules: The Daily Web

- You are working on "The Daily Web" news management system.
- Tech stack: Node.js, Express, MongoDB (Mongoose), EJS (SSR), Vanilla JavaScript (AJAX/Fetch), CSS Flexbox.
- STRICT RULE: Do not use React, Vue, Angular, jQuery, or frontend bundling tools.
- Maintain MVC architecture: keep DB queries in models/services, HTTP handling in controllers, and views in EJS.
- Ensure all sessions are persistent in MongoDB (`connect-mongo`).
- Ensure rate limiting (3 comments/min for guests) on comment creation endpoint.
- For reporter article editing, support autosave and dual-version draft management for already-published articles.
- For editor workspace, provide side-by-side diff comparison and Chart.js impact analytics with update markers.
